, 255);\">2018. 9. 3.(</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 9. 21.(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></span></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림 !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: dotum;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - 예산 소진에 따라 조기 마감 될 수 있음</span></span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림 !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: dotum;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">5. 봉사종료 : 교육봉사, 재능봉사, 노력봉사 등</span><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림 !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: dotum;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림 !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: dotum;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">* 문의처 : 학생처 학생지원팀 054-478-7040</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
